    'Nha Trang' => [
        ['A coastal city facing an island-filled bay', 'Nha Trang combines a long urban beachfront with a bay dotted with islands. It has a lively holiday atmosphere, yet the sea remains the centre of the experience. A morning walk, a boat outing and a seafood dinner offer different ways to enjoy the same coastal setting.'],
        ['On the water and beyond the beach', 'Island excursions bring a change of perspective from the city shoreline, with activities depending on the route and sea conditions. Back on land, mud baths and mineral-water experiences add another option for a slower day. The appeal is the ability to mix time outdoors with time simply relaxing.'],
        ['Heritage beside the coast', 'The Po Nagar towers introduce Cham heritage and provide a cultural counterpoint to the beaches. Temples and neighbourhoods add further reasons to explore beyond the resort. Nha Trang suits a journey that leaves space for several moods: active time on the bay, an introduction to local history and an easy evening by the water.'],
